<title>INDIA: Indian March industrial output up 2.9 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Indian March industrial output up 2.9 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's index of industrial production increased by 2.9 percent in March over the same month in 1996, the government said.</p>
<p>    INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION     Mar 97    Feb 97    Mar 96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +2.9	+3.2	+9.7</p>
<p>     -Mining			 +1.3	+0.2	+3.6</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing		+2.8	+3.9     +11.4</p>
<p>     -Electricity		  +5.2	+1.4	+5.7</p>
<p>    Index (base 100=1980/81)  342.7     317.4     333.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for March 1997 are preliminary. Figures for February 1997 have been revised.  </p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    CUMULATIVE		     Apr96-Mar97    Apr95-Mar96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		+6.7	    +11.6</p>
<p>     -Mining			     +1.2	     +7.4</p>
<p>     -Manufacturing		    +8.0	    +13.0</p>
<p>     -Electricity			+3.8	     +8.1</p>
<p>     Index (base 100=1980/81)     302.2	    283.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for March 1997 are preliminary</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
